<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    O/N = 5.11%				    O/N = 9.37%</p>
<p>	    T/N = 7.67%				    T/N =10.22%</p>
<p>		   Aug 26, 1996			 Aug 23, 1996</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  8.18%	1 month forward =  8.86%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  9.37%	2 month forward =  9.54%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  9.99%	3 month forward =  9.99%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward = 10.05%	4 month forward = 10.39%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward = 10.83%	5 month forward = 10.97%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward = 10.81%	6 month forward = 10.80%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
